# agent hooks installed from @ekdotico/domico by postinstall — a build output,
# not a source. Change the hook in that package and release; a copy committed
# here is a hand-maintained twin of a file the installer owns. A hook that is
# genuinely local to this repository is exempted by name, the way docs and
# praktico exempt their design-system reminder.
/.claude/hooks/*
